        "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/download/",
        "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK25497/"
      ],
      "status": "researched_not_staged",
      "sync_notes": "Annual baseline then ordered daily updates at scale; bounded ESearch/EFetch first. No API key: 3 requests/second maximum; shared-IP budgets must be coordinated."
